# PERF-P2 / O-P2-2 sweep output. Unlike its two sibling experiments, this directory ships NO
# committed dataset: the box it must be measured on is a GitHub-hosted runner, so the rows arrive as
# a workflow artifact and a run worth keeping goes onto its own measurement branch (`git add -f`).
# Ignored so a local harness run cannot be swept into a commit and read later as evidence from the
# runner class it was never taken on.
experiments/perf-p2-window/data/
